hadiths[132]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawari wala us ke agle hisse ka zyada haqdar hai."
"3751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawari wala us ke agle hisse ka zyada haqdar hai, magar jo ijazat de."
"3752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Soor wala soor ko apne munh par rakhe hue hai jab se paida hua, intezar kar raha hai ke use kab hukm diya jaye ke us mein phoonke to wo phoonke."
"3753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilm wale ke liye har cheez maghfirat mangti hai yahan tak ke samundar mein machhli."
"3754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ki subah suraj bila-shu'a tuloo hota hai goya tasht hai yahan tak ke buland ho jaye."
"3755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Masood ne sach kaha: tumhara shohar aur tumhara beta us ke zyada haqdar hain jis par tum ne unhein sadqa diya."
"3756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sach kaha to us ne use sachcha kar diya."
"3757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke Rasool ne sach kaha: Tumhare maal aur tumhari auladein to aazmaish hain. Maine in do bachchon ko chalte aur thokar khate dekha to sabr na kar saka yahan tak ke apni guftagu kaati aur unhein uthaya."
"3758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ki tasdeeq musalman ka bhai hai."
"3759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhupe sadqe Rab ke ghusse ko bujha deta hai."
"3760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhupe sadqe Rab ke ghusse ko bujha deta hai, sila-rehmi umar mein izafa karta hai aur neki buri maut se bachati hai."
"3761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa-e-Fitr khajoor ka aik sa' ya jau ka aik sa' ya gehun ke do mudd hai, har chhote, bare, aazaad aur ghulam ki taraf se."
"3762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa jo Allah ne tum par kiya; pas us ka sadqa qubool karo."
"3763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rishtedar ka rishtedar par sadqa sadqa bhi hai aur sila bhi."
"3764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare chhote jannat ke nanhe bachche hain; un mein se aik apne baap se milega aur us ka kapra pakar lega; pas nahi rukega yahan tak ke Allah use aur us ke baap ko jannat mein dakhil kar de."
"3765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen mein se Allah ki pasandeeda Shaam hai aur us mein us ki makhlooq aur bandon mein se us ke pasandeeda hain; aur meri ummat mein se aik giroh zaroor jannat mein dakhil hoga jin par na hisaab hoga na azab."
"3766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sila-rehmi umar mein izafa karti hai aur chhupe sadqe Rab ke ghusse ko bujha deta hai."
"3767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sila-rehmi, achcha akhlaq aur achcha paros gharon ko aabaad karte hain aur umron mein izafa karte hain."
"3768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rishtedari maal mein kasrat, ghar walon mein mohabbat aur muddat mein mo'akhkhar hona hai."
"3769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhein kaate use joro, jo tum se burayi kare us se achchayi karo, aur haq kaho chahe tumhare nafs par ho."
"3770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz us ke waqt par parho; phir agar tum imam ko pao ke wo unhein namaz parha raha hai to un ke saath parho; tum ne apni namaz mehfooz kar li; warna wo tumhare liye nafl hai."
"3771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz us ke waqt par parho; phir agar tum un ke saath pao to parho aur na kaho ke maine parh li hai, pas nahi parhunga."
"3772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surah Shams aur us jaise surton se namaz parhao."
"3773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ke kamzor-tareen ki namaz se namaz parhao; aur aisa muazzin na rakho jo apni azan par ujrat le."
"3774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do rakaatein parho, un mein takhfeef karo; aur jab tum mein se koi aaye jabke imam Juma ke din khutba de raha ho to do rakaatein parhe aur unhein halki kare."
"3775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr ki namaz parho phir suraj tuloo hone tak namaz se ruk jao yahan tak ke buland ho jaye; kyunke wo jab tuloo hota hai to shaitan ke donon seengon ke darmiyan tuloo hota hai aur us waqt kafir use sajda karte hain. Phir namaz parho; kyunke namaz dekhi hui hazir-ki hui hai yahan tak ke saya neze par seedha ho jaye. Phir namaz se ruk jao; kyunke us waqt jahannam bharakayi jati hai. Phir jab saya laut aaye to namaz parho; kyunke namaz dekhi hui hazir-ki hui hai yahan tak ke Asr parho. Phir suraj ghuroob hone tak namaz se ruk jao; kyunke wo shaitan ke donon seengon ke darmiyan ghuroob hota hai aur us waqt kafir use sajda karte hain."
"3776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rukhsat hone wale ki namaz parho goya tum use dekhte ho; phir agar tum use nahi dekhte to wo tumhein dekhta hai. Aur jo logon ke haathon mein hai us se na-ummeed ho jao, ghani hokar zindagi guzaroge; aur us se bacho jis mein uzr pesh karna pare."
"3777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khare hokar namaz parho magar ye ke tumhein doobne ka darr ho."
"3778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khare hokar namaz parho; phir agar taaqat na rakho to baith kar; phir agar taaqat na rakho to pehlu par."
"3779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz parho ae logon apne gharon mein; kyunke afzal namaz aadmi ki apne ghar mein namaz hai, siwa farz ke."
"3780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maghrib ki namaz suraj doobne ke saath parho; sitara nikalne se pehle us mein jaldi karo."
"3781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ambiya par durood bhejo jab tum mera zikr karo; kyunke wo aise bheje gaye jaise main bheja gaya."
"3782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke ambiya aur us ke Rasoolon par durood bhejo; kyunke Allah ne unhein bheja jaise us ne mujhe bheja."
"3783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par durood bhejo aur dua mein koshish karo aur kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad par aur Aal-e-Muhammad par durood bhej aur Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat de jaise tune Ibrahim aur Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat di; beshak tu hamd wala buzurg hai."
"3784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein namaz parho aur unhein qabrein na banao."
"3785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein namaz parho aur unhein qabrein na banao; aur mere ghar ko eidgah na banao; aur mujh par durood bhejo aur salam bhejo; kyunke tumhara durood mujhe pahuncha diya jata hai tum jahan kahin ho."
"3786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein namaz parho aur un mein nafl na chhoro."
"3787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ke baron mein namaz parho aur oonton ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz na parho."
"3788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ke baron mein namaz parho aur oonton ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz na parho; kyunke wo shaitanon mein se paida ki gayin hain."
"3789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ke rewar mein namaz parho aur un ki naak ponchho; kyunke wo jannat ke janwaron mein se hain."
"3790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne jooton mein namaz parho aur Yahudiyon se mushabihat na karo."
"3791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maghrib se pehle do rakaatein parho; Maghrib se pehle do rakaatein parho, jo chahe."
"3792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijr mein namaz parho agar tum Baitullah mein dakhil hona chaho; kyunke wo Baitullah ka tukra hai; lekin tumhari qaum ne use chhota kar diya jab Kaaba banaya to use Baitullah se bahar kar diya."
"3793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Afzal roza rakho: Dawood ka roza; aik din roza aur aik din iftar."
"3794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr ke maheene ka roza rakho, Ramazan; sabr ke maheene ka roza rakho aur har maheene mein teen din..... ..."
"3795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki ke kaam buri maut, aafaton aur halakaton se bachate hain; aur duniya mein neki wale aakhirat mein neki wale hain."
"3796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki ke kaam buri maut se bachate hain; chhupe sadqe Rab ke ghusse ko bujha deta hai; sila-rehmi umar mein izafa hai; har neki sadqa hai; duniya mein neki wale aakhirat mein neki wale hain; aur duniya mein burayi wale aakhirat mein burayi wale hain,........ ..."
"3797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki ke kaam buri maut se bachate hain; chhupe sadqe Rab ke ghusse ko bujha deta hai; aur sila-rehmi umar mein izafa karti hai."
"3798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se do qismein hain jinhein meri shafa'at nahi pahunchegi: zalim dhokebaaz imam aur har hadd se barhne wala nikalne wala."
"3799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-aag mein se do qismein hain jinhein maine abhi nahi dekha: qaum jin ke paas gaayon ki dumon jaise kode honge jin se wo logon ko maarenge; aur auratein kapre pehne hue nangi, maael karne wali maael hone wali, un ke sar jhuki hui Bukhti oontniyon ki kohaanon jaise honge; wo jannat mein dakhil nahi hongi aur us ki khushbu nahi payengi jabke us ki khushbu itni itni musafat se payi jati hai."
"3800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lashkar mein Abu Talha ki aawaz hazaar mardon se behtar hai."
"3801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aawazein duniya aur aakhirat mein mal'oon hain: ne'mat ke waqt baaja; aur museebat ke waqt cheekh."
"3802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maheene mein teen din ka roza aur Ramazan se Ramazan tak zamane bhar ka roza aur iftar hai."
"3803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr ke maheene ka roza aur har maheene mein teen din ka roza zamane bhar ka roza hai."
"3804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr ke maheene ka roza aur har maheene mein teen din ka roza seene ki jalan door karte hain."
"3805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arafa ke din ka roza guzre saal aur aane wale saal ka kaffara hai."
"3806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arafa ke din ka roza do saal ka kaffara hai, guzra aur aane wala; aur Aashura ka roza guzre saal ka kaffara hai."
"3807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara roza jis din tum roza rakhte ho aur tumhari qurbani jis din tum qurbani karte ho."
"3808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maheene ka roza rakho aur us ke aakhir ka."
"3809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo; phir agar tumhare aur us ke darmiyan baadal haael ho to Shabaan ki ginti poori karo; maheene ka istiqbaal na karo aur Ramazan ko Shabaan ke din se na milao."
"3810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to Shabaan tees poora karo."
"3811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo aur us ke liye qurbani karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees poore karo; phir agar do musalman gawah gawahi dein to roza rakho aur iftar karo."
"3812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roshni se roshni tak roza rakho."
"3813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni behan ki taraf se roza rakho."
"3814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ki apne ghar mein namaz meri is masjid mein us ki namaz se behtar hai, siwa farz ke."
"3815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Awwabeen ki namaz jab oont ke bachche garmi mehsoos karein."
"3816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baith kar namaz parhne wale ki namaz khare hokar namaz parhne wale ki aadhi hai."
"3817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele namaz se pachees hisson se afzal hai."
"3818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se pachees ke barabar hai."
"3819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se pachees darje fazeelat rakhti hai."
"3820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se sattais darje fazeelat rakhti hai."
"3821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki nafl namaz jahan use log nahi dekhte, logon ki aankhon par us ki namaz se pachees ke barabar hai."
"3822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jama'at mein namaz pachees darje barhti hai......."
"3823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jama'at mein namaz us ki apne ghar mein namaz aur us ke bazaar mein namaz se pachees darje barhti hai; aur ye is liye ke tum mein se jab koi wuzu kare aur achchi tarah wuzu kare, phir masjid aaye aur siwa namaz ke kuch na chahe to us ne jo qadam uthaya Allah us se us ka darja buland karega aur us se us ka gunah mitayega yahan tak ke masjid mein dakhil ho; phir jab masjid mein dakhil hua to namaz mein raha jab tak namaz use roke rakhe; aur farishte us par durood bhejte hain jab tak wo apni us majlis mein rahe jis mein wo namaz parhta hai, kehte hain: Ae Allah, use bakhsh de; ae Allah, us par rehem farma; ae Allah, us ki tauba qubool farma; jab tak wo us mein takleef na de ya be-wuzu na ho."
"3824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jama'at mein namaz us ki akele namaz se pachees darje barhti hai; phir jab wo use khule maidan mein parhe aur us ka wuzu, rukoo aur sajda poora kare to us ki namaz pachaas darje ko pahunchti hai."
"3825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki khare hokar namaz us ki baith kar namaz se behtar hai; us ki baith kar namaz us ki khare hokar namaz ki aadhi hai; aur us ki lete namaz us ki baith kar namaz ki aadhi hai."
"3826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki baith kar namaz aadhi namaz hai; lekin main tum mein se kisi jaise nahi."
"3827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaasht ki namaz awwabeen ki namaz hai."
"3828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baith kar namaz parhne wale ki namaz khare hokar namaz parhne wale ki aadhi hai."
"3829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do hai; phir jab tum mein se koi subah se dare to aik rakaat parhe jo us ke liye us ko witr kar de jo us ne parhi."
"3830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do hai aur witr raat ke aakhir mein aik rakaat hai."
"3831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raat aur din ki namaz do do hai."
"3833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat ki apne ghar mein namaz us ki kothri mein namaz se behtar hai; aur us ki apne sone ke kamre mein namaz us ki apne ghar mein namaz se behtar hai."
"3834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maghrib ki namaz din ka witr hai."
"3835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darmiyani namaz Asr ki namaz hai."
"3836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aadmiyon ki namaz jin mein se aik doosre ki imamat kare, Allah ke nazdeek musalsal chaar ki namaz se paakeeza-tar hai; aur chaar ki namaz jin ki imamat un mein se aik kare, Allah ke nazdeek musalsal aath ki namaz se paakeeza-tar hai; aur aath ki namaz jin ki imamat un mein se aik kare, Allah ke nazdeek musalsal sau ki namaz se paakeeza-tar hai."
"3837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz ke peeche namaz jis ke darmiyan koi laghw na ho, Illiyyeen mein kitaab hai."
"3838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri masjid mein namaz us ke siwa mein hazaar namaz se behtar hai, siwa Masjid-e-Haraam ke; aur Masjid-e-Haraam mein namaz us ke siwa mein aik laakh namaz se behtar hai."
"3839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz masjidon mein se us ke siwa mein hazaar namaz se behtar hai, siwa Masjid-e-Haraam ke."
"3840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz masjidon mein se us ke siwa mein hazaar namaz se behtar hai, siwa Masjid-e-Haraam ke; kyunke main ambiya mein aakhri hun aur meri masjid masjidon mein aakhri hai."
"3841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz masjidon mein se us ke siwa mein hazaar namaz se behtar hai, siwa Masjid-e-Haraam ke; aur Masjid-e-Haraam mein namaz meri is masjid mein namaz se sau namaz se behtar hai."
"3842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam ke saath namaz us ki akele parhi hui pachees namaz se behtar hai."
"3843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do namazein hain jin ke baad namaz nahi parhi jayegi: Fajr suraj tuloo hone tak aur Asr suraj ghuroob hone tak."
"3844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum aurton ki apne gharon mein namaz tumhari apni kothriyon mein namaz se behtar hai; tumhari apni kothriyon mein namaz tumhari apne gharon mein namaz se behtar hai; aur tumhari apne gharon mein namaz tumhari jama'at ki masjid mein namaz se behtar hai."
"3845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ke awwal ki islaah zuhd aur yaqeen se hai; aur us ke aakhir halaak honge kanjoosi aur ummeed se."
"3846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachche ka girte waqt cheekhna shaitan ke chhune se hai."
"3847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka Allah ke raaste mein roza use jahannam se sattar saal ki musafat door karta hai."
"3848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maheene mein teen din ka roza zamane bhar ka roza aur iftar hai."
"3849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maheene mein teen din ka roza zamane bhar ka roza hai; aur wo ayyam-e-beez hain: terah, chaudah aur pandrah ki subah."
"3850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achcha roza maheene mein teen din ka roza hai."
"3851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan ke maheene ka roza das maheenon se hai aur us ke baad chhe din ka roza do maheenon se hai; pas ye saal ka roza hai."
"3852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hafta ke din ka roza na tumhare liye hai na tum par hai."
"3853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arafa ke din ka roza: main Allah se ummeed rakhta hun ke wo us se pehle saal aur us ke baad saal ka kaffara kar de; aur Aashura ke din ka roza: main Allah se ummeed rakhta hun ke wo us se pehle saal ka kaffara kar de."
"3854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nafl roza rakhne wala apne nafs ka ameer hai: agar chahe roza rakhe aur agar chahe iftar kare."
"3855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr karne wala sabr pehli chot par hai."
"3856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr pehli chot par hai."
"3857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr pehli thokar par hai."
"3858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miskeen par sadqa sadqa hai; aur wo rishtedar par do hain: sadqa aur sila."
"3859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Poora pehlwan wo jo ghusse mein aaye to us ka ghussa shadeed ho, us ka chehra surkh ho, us ke baal khare hon, phir wo apne ghusse ko pichhaar de."
"3860","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paak mitti musalman ka wuzu hai chahe wo das saal paani na paye."
"3861","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mitti musalman ka wuzu hai chahe wo das saal paani na paye; phir jab paani paye to Allah se dare aur use apni khaal se lagaye; kyunke ye behtar hai."
"3862","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sulah musalmanon ke darmiyan jaiz hai, magar wo sulah jo haraam ko halal kare ya halal ko haraam kare."
"3863","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Soor seeng hai jis mein phoonka jayega."
"3864","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tasweer sar hai; phir jab sar kaata jaye to tasweer nahi."
"3865","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai."
"3866","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza Allah ke azab se dhaal hai."
"3867","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai jis se banda aag se bachta hai."
"3868","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sardi mein roza thandi ghaneemat hai."
"3869","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza jis din tum roza rakhte ho, iftar jis din tum iftar karte ho, aur qurbani jis din tum qurbani karte ho."
"3870","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz behtareen rakhi hui cheez hai; pas jo taaqat rakhe ke zyada kare to zyada kare."
"3871","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at mein namaz pachees namaz ke barabar hai; phir jab wo use jungle mein parhe aur us ka rukoo aur sajda poora kare to pachaas namaz ko pahunchti hai."
"3872","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid-e-Quba mein namaz umre jaise hai."
"3873","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz aur jo tumhare dayen haathon ke malik hain; namaz aur jo tumhare dayen haathon ke malik hain."
"3874","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazein darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hain jab kabeera gunahon se bacha jaye; aur Juma se Juma tak aur teen din zyada."
"3875","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazein, Juma se Juma tak aur Ramazan se Ramazan tak darmiyan ke gunahon ko mitane wale hain jab kabeera gunahon se bacha jaye."
"3876","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai."
"3877","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai; aur jab tum mein se koi rozedar ho to behayai na kare, jahalat na kare; aur agar koi us se lare ya use gaali de to kahe: Main rozedar hun, do baar. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada paakeeza hai; wo apna khana, peena aur khwahish meri wajah se chhorta hai; roza mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga; aur neki das guna hai."
"3878","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza aag se dhaal hai; pas jo subah rozedar ho to us din jahalat na kare; aur agar koi us par jahalat kare to use gaali na de, bura na kahe aur kahe ke main rozedar hun. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada paakeeza hai."
"3879","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza aag se dhaal hai jaise tum mein se kisi ki laraai se dhaal."
"3880","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal aur aag se mazboot qila hai."
"3881","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza dhaal hai aur wo momin ke qilon mein se qila hai; aur har amal us ke malik ke liye hai siwa roze ke; Allah farmata hai: Roza mere liye hai aur main us ka badla dunga."
"3882","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza aur Quran bande ke liye qayamat ke din shafa'at karenge: roza kahega: Ae mere Rab, maine use din mein khane aur khwahishon se roka, pas us ke baare mein meri shafa'at qubool farma. Quran kahega: Ae mere Rab, maine use raat mein neend se roka, pas us ke baare mein meri shafa'at qubool farma. Pas donon ki shafa'at qubool ki jayegi."
